    "description": "During this campaign,  50 volcanic and subvolcanic rock samples were collected,\n which were described petrographically. In general they are porphyritic rocks\ncomposed of  phenocrysts of plagioclase, olivine, and clinopyroxene in an\nintergranular-intersectional fundamental mass, some with pilotaxitic and/or \namydaloidal textures.",
